    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nThis charming detached property, requiring refurbishment and restoration, offers a wonderful opportunity to create a truly special home in an attractive and peaceful rural setting, subject to the necessary planning permissions.\n\nIdeally situated in the village of Lorrha, the property is just a 10-minute drive from Portumna and all its amenities, while Limerick City Centre is approximately one hour away.\n\nWith its appealing countryside location and excellent accessibility, this property presents an exciting opportunity for those seeking a project with the potential to create a beautiful home in a tranquil setting."
